A line block behind nested markers takes a lazy line after a fence-shaped payload

```
- - ::: |
    ~~~
b
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <div class="line-block">
          <p>~~~<br>
b</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- 1. ::: |
     ~~~~ js
b
c
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <ol>
      <li>
        <div class="line-block">
          <p>~~~~ js<br>
b<br>
c</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </li>
</ul>
```

